        {
          "text": "Pele nkucili cintu comwe ncimuteelede kuluba, nomuyandwa. Nceeci cakuti kuli-Jehova buzuba bomwe buli mbuli cuulu camyaaka, acalo cuulu camyaaka cili mbuli buzuba bomwe buyo. ",
