          "text": "Buzuba bwa-Jehova bulasika mbubonya mbwasika mubbi, Kulimbubo ijulu liyooindilila acamuzunzumina mupati, tunyenyeezi tuyooyaka akubomboloka, ayalo nyika iyootentwa azicitwa kulinjiyo.",
